% Create email ARFF data (Length, ContainsLink, ContainsAttachment, Class); use Naive Bayes to classify a test instance.

@relation email_spam

@attribute Length {Short,Long}
@attribute ContainsLink {Yes,No}
@attribute ContainsAttachment {Yes,No}
@attribute Class {Spam,NotSpam}

@data
Short,No,No,NotSpam
Long,Yes,Yes,Spam
Short,Yes,No,Spam
Long,No,No,NotSpam
Long,Yes,Yes,Spam
Short,No,Yes,NotSpam
Long,Yes,No,Spam
Short,No,No,NotSpam
